{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24933","headline":"省试临渊羡鱼 · 徐牧","name":"省试临渊羡鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清泚濯缨处，今来喜一临。\n慙无下钓处，空有羡鱼心。\n退省时频改，谋身岁屡沈。\n鬣成川上媚，网就水宁深。\n頳尾临波里，朱须破浪浔。\n此时傥不漏，江上免行吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}